{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ① 기본","level":1,"title":"마지막 글자 꺼내기","desc":"<p>문자열 <code>s</code>(비어 있지 않아요)의 <b>마지막 글자</b>를 돌려주는 함수 <code>last_char(s)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def last_char(s):\n    pass\n","solution":"def last_char(s):\n    return s[-1]\n","hint":"<p>마지막은 인덱스 <code>-1</code>이에요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"last_char(\"hello\")","expected":"o","visible":true},{"call":"last_char(\"ab\")","expected":"b","visible":true},{"call":"last_char(\"x\")","expected":"x","visible":false},{"call":"last_char(\"가나다\")","expected":"다","visible":false}],"id":"py-299"}